      <h1>Find a Dairy Queen Location Near You (2026 Guide)</h1>
      <p>With over <strong>4,400 stores across the United States</strong> and more than 7,700 operating worldwide, finding a Dairy Queen is convenient almost anywhere you travel. Whether you are craving an upside-down Blizzard Treat or a fresh hot Stackburger meal, use this independent guide to understand operating hours, store formats, and official locator tools.</p>

