    <h2>Finding Your Nearest Store on the Official Website</h2>
    <p>Because operating hours, drive-thru lanes, and holiday schedules are managed directly by each franchise owner, we recommend checking the official store finder before driving over: <a href="https://www.dairyqueen.com/en-us/locator/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">dairyqueen.com/en-us/locator/</a>.</p>
    <p>You can also download the official DQ mobile app on iOS or Android to place mobile orders ahead of time and earn DQ Rewards points on qualifying food and treat purchases.</p>

    <h2>Understanding DQ Store Formats: Grill &amp; Chill vs. Treat</h2>
    <p>Before visiting, it helps to confirm which type of DQ location is closest to you:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>DQ Grill &amp; Chill® Locations</strong>: These are full-scale freestanding restaurants featuring both the hot grill menu (Stackburgers, chicken baskets, cheese curds, fries, and breakfast at select spots) and the full line of frozen soft-serve treats.</li>
      <li><strong>DQ® Treat Locations</strong>: Typically situated inside shopping malls, airport terminals, and travel plazas, these focus purely on desserts — Blizzards, soft-serve cones, sundaes, Royal treats, and take-home ice cream cakes. They generally do not serve savory food like burgers or chicken strips.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Highest State Concentrations</h2>
    <p>Dairy Queen has deep Midwestern and Southern roots. Texas leads the nation with more than 600 locations, followed closely by Minnesota (DQ's corporate birthplace), Ohio, Illinois, and Missouri. Texas locations even feature a unique "Texas Country Foods" regional menu that includes the beloved Dude® chicken-fried steak sandwich and jalapeño strips.</p>

    <h2>International Presence</h2>
    <p>Globally, Dairy Queen thrives in over 20 nations, including Canada, China, Saudi Arabia, the United Arab Emirates, Thailand, and South Korea. Many international outlets offer localized twists on familiar Blizzards, incorporating green tea, durian, or mango flavours tailored to regional palates.</p>

